Template: homelab-block-link/db_host
Type: string
Default: localhost
Description: PostgreSQL host to bootstrap this app's roles/schema on:
 Used only once, at first install, to run homelab-bootstrap-app-role.

Template: homelab-block-link/pgbouncer_host
Type: string
Default: localhost
Description: PgBouncer host to register this app's runtime role with:
 Used only once, at first install. Also written into config.yml's
 database.host, so the running service connects through the pooler.

Template: homelab-block-link/api_base
Type: string
Default: http://localhost:3000
Description: Base URL where homelab-api is reachable:
 Written into config.yml's homelab_api.base_url -- every gateway-routed
 request this app handles is authenticated by introspecting the
 caller's JWT here, and this service's own /l/:token submit handler
 looks up homelab-domain-admin's address via this same homelab-api's
 service registry.

Template: homelab-block-link/listen_port
Type: string
Default: 2515
Description: Port for homelab-block-link to listen on:

Template: homelab-block-link/advertise_host
Type: string
Default: 127.0.0.1
Description: This host's own address to advertise in the service registry:
 Written into config.yml's registry.host -- what homelab-api's gateway
 actually connects to when forwarding /api/v1/block-link/* requests
 here. Leave as 127.0.0.1 only if this service runs on the SAME host as
 homelab-api itself; set it to this host's real reachable address for
 any distributed deployment.

Template: homelab-block-link/public_base_url
Type: string
Default: https://blockemail.test.mailmasker.org
Description: Public URL where the management page is reachable:
 Written into every generated management link -- must match whatever
 homelab-webproxy's sites.yml actually fronts this service as.

Template: homelab-block-link/link_ttl_days
Type: string
Default: 90
Description: Days a management link stays valid before it expires:
 Long-lived by design (unlike homelab-invite's one-time-use tokens) --
 revisiting the same link later to adjust a decision is the normal use.
